Note 2026-10-25: the guard rejects any sum outside [-32767, 32767], so an exact
-32768 (representable in int16) is also rejected and counted. Negligible; kept
as is so the guard stays symmetric. git apply ignores this text before the
first diff header; the hunks below are unchanged.

